; ------------------------------------------------------------
; Vole Machine Program 2
; Purpose: Multiply 3 * 4 = 12 by repeated addition and
;          display the result on the screen.
;          Demonstrates a loop using conditional JUMP.
; Note: B0XY always jumps because R0 == R0 (unconditional jump).
; ------------------------------------------------------------
2103 ; [00] R1 = 03 (addend)
2204 ; [02] R2 = 04 (loop counter)
2300 ; [04] R3 = 00 (accumulator)
24FF ; [06] R4 = FF (-1 in two's complement)
2000 ; [08] R0 = 00 (zero for comparison)
5331 ; [0A] R3 = R3 + R1 (accumulate)
5224 ; [0C] R2 = R2 + R4 (counter--)
B214 ; [0E] If R2 == R0, jump to 14 (done)
B00A ; [10] Always jump back to 0A
C000 ; [12] Safety halt (never reached)
33FF ; [14] Print R3 (12 = 0C hex)
C000 ; [16] Halt
